{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":8707643,"ns":0,"title":"Electronic circuit","extract":"An electronic circuit is composed of individual electronic components, such as resistors, transistors, capacitors, inductors and diodes, connected by conductive wires or traces through which electric current can flow. It is a type of electrical circuit.","description":"Electrical circuit with active components","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}